          "src/carrot_core (account_secrets, destination, payment_proposal, scan)",
          "src/cryptonote_basic (address base58 encode/decode used by CARROT destinations)",
          "tests/unit_tests/curve_trees.cpp (upstream test-tree helpers, compiled unchanged)",
